Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:01.86,Default,,0,0,150,,Coming up on {\i1}Punirunes...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.36,0:00:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Squishy squishy, puni puni\NPunirunes! (Rune-rune!)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.86,0:00:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Squishy squishy, pet it, take care of it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.28,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Squishy squishy, puni puni\NPunirunes! (Rune-rune!)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.82,0:00:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Let's play, Punirunes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.82,0:00:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The show is squishing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.79,0:00:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Punirunes. Before we knew it, these creatures\Nbegan to inhabit the human world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.75,0:00:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They're squishsterious and soft to the touch!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.92,0:00:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,They all love to be squished.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.34,0:00:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes they're kachi-freezy and hard too!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.26,0:00:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,These are some merry, adorable puni-pals.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.89,0:00:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows, there could be\Na Punirune right next to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.73,0:00:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,"The Field Day at Puni School{\fnSegoe UI Symbol}♪{\fnAvenir LT Std 65 Medium}"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.33,0:01:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Attention! It's time for the\NGrand Puni School Field Day to begin!"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.13,0:01:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"The captain of the Red Team is Enerune!"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.96,0:01:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"The captain of the White Team is Tomorune!"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.14,0:01:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Red Team, White Team, do your bests out there!"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.06,0:01:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let's hear the oath of sportsmanship\Nfrom Tomorune and Enerune.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.19,0:01:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"All puni for one,"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.94,0:01:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"one puni for all,"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.03,0:01:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"and one for all... puni?"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.03,0:01:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They forgot what they were going to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.70,0:01:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Activipuni #1:"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.79,0:01:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"instead of Ball Toss, it's Babyrune Toss!"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.29,0:01:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Whichever team has more Babyrunes\Nin their basket wins."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.13,0:01:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Red Team, White Team, good luck!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.35,0:02:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"One down for the Red Team."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.74,0:02:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Red Team is up to 3."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.12,0:02:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Hang in there, White Team!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.92,0:02:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh my! It's Happyrune, Devilrune, and Angelrune!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.43,0:02:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Here are the results."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.43,0:02:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Red Team: 11—"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.81,0:02:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"White Team: 13."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.15,0:02:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"The Babyrune Toss goes to the White Team!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.98,0:02:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The White Team gets 1 point!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.61,0:02:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Cuprune is making cotton puni.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.66,0:03:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Next is activipuni #2: Puni-Fluffy Flight!"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.29,0:03:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Whichever team gets past that cloud first wins."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.59,0:03:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Participating from the Red Team\Nare Utarune, Loverune, and Gaorune."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.30,0:03:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"From the opposing White Team\Nare the Sushirunes."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.41,0:03:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Red Team takes the lead!"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.08,0:03:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Try to reach the goal without\Ngetting hit by rain drops!"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.59,0:03:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Gaorune's roar turns anything squishy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.18,0:04:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It turned the Sushirunes even squishier.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.56,0:04:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're taking advantage of their super squishy bodies!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.45,0:04:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I-Is this...?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.12,0:04:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Squishy Stream Attack!!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.87,0:04:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Does this even count as puni-fluffy flight?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.26,0:04:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"The White Team wins!"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.05,0:04:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}White Team now has 2 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.68,0:04:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"And now for the cheering competition\Nfrom both teams."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.27,0:04:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"The Red Team's cheer leader is..."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.06,0:04:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Airune's superfan Oshirune!"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.98,0:04:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"The opposing White Team's cheer leader is..."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.82,0:05:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"illuminating everyone with its soft light, Hikarune!"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.07,0:05:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Let's go, let's go, Red Team!"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.29,0:05:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Let's go, let's go, Airune!"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.76,0:05:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}O-Oshirune, stand down!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.47,0:05:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Stand down! Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.93,0:05:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Next up is the White Team's cheer!"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.06,0:05:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Oh? Where is Hikarune?"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.94,0:05:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hikarune is somewhat bashful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.20,0:05:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Activipuni #3:"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.49,0:05:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"instead of Big Ball Race,\Nit's Big Pumpkin Race!"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.42,0:05:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Roll your pumpkins around the turning point."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.09,0:06:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"The first team back to the start wins."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.64,0:06:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Red Team takes the lead!"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.95,0:06:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"The Big Pumpkin Race goes to the White Team!"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.21,0:06:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}White Team now has 3 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.21,0:06:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"White Team has a big lead!"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.38,0:06:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Red Team, don't give up!\NKeep going strong until the end!"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.93,0:06:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"The final activipuni is..."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.48,0:06:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"the Puni-Pal Scavenger Hunt Race!"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.77,0:06:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"The winning team gets..."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.32,0:07:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"100 points!"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.78,0:07:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Acquire the item drawn on your paper."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.33,0:07:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"The first team to the finish line wins."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.92,0:08:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Both teams are racing towards the goal\Nwith their items.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.97,0:08:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Who won the race?"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.34,0:08:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"It's a photo-finish!"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.44,0:09:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"It's the Red Team's Enerune!"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.82,0:09:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"White Team, 3 points—"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.07,0:09:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Red Team, 100 points—"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.57,0:09:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Red Team wins!"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.79,0:09:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"And now, Enerune, captain of the winning Red Team!"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.46,0:09:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"What are your thoughts on the Field Day?"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.05,0:09:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"I want {\i1}every{\i0} day to be Field Day!"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.64,0:09:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And from that point on,\Nevery day after the next
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.39,0:09:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}was Field Day at Puni School.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.15,0:09:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The Puni-Pal Files!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.40,0:09:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, I'll tell you about...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.44,0:09:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorune!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.53,0:09:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorune is cheerful and full of curiosity!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.20,0:10:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's very good at breakdancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.17,0:10:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It can make puni-pals with anyone in a flash!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.76,0:10:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for the Puni-Pal Squestion!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.22,0:10:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Which puni-pal did Tomorune acquire\Nin the Scavenger Hunt Race?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.15,0:10:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(230.67,326)}1. Airune
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.56,0:10:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(230.67,494)}2. Enerune
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.23,0:10:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(230.67,659.33)}3. Loverune
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.86,0:10:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(230.67,835.33)}4. Pikarune
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.52,0:10:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(230.67,1008.66)}5. Jewelrune
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.11,0:10:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(1036,326)}6. Cuprune
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.69,0:10:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(1036,494)}7. Otorune
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.32,0:10:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(1036,659.33)}8. Fairune
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.90,0:10:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(1036,835.33)}9. Togerune
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.95,0:10:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the answer...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.08,0:10:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,8. Fairune!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.10,0:11:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Airune, where are you and Tomorune going?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.03,0:11:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're meeting with Unirune?\NIt's been a while!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.16,0:12:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to go play together\Nin Kachikochiland? Sounds like fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.95,0:12:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Have fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.16,0:12:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Next time: "Unirune's Trip in Kachikochiland{\fnSegoe UI Symbol}♪{\fnAvenir LT Std 65 Medium}"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.13,0:12:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Puni" in next time!
